Package: seqout
Title: Client for Querying the 'SeqOut' Genomics Metadata Database
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Search and download genomics study metadata from 'SeqOut'
    <https://seqout.org>, which indexes NCBI GEO, NCBI SRA, EBI ENA, DDBJ
    (DRA and GEA), ArrayExpress and GSA. 
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/saketlab/seqout, https://seqout.org, https://seqout.org/cli/R/
